kau mungkin akan merasa bersalah.

488
00:32:19,415 --> 00:32:20,851
Merasa itu terjadi karenamu.

489
00:32:20,895 --> 00:32:23,593
Tapi jangan khawatir. Kau sudah cek.

490
00:32:23,637 --> 00:32:25,552
Hatimu sekarang tenang.

491
00:32:26,770 --> 00:32:28,598
Ya Tuhan.

492
00:32:29,599 --> 00:32:30,731
Turunkan kacanya.

493
00:32:35,388 --> 00:32:36,737
Apa kau ayahnya Kenna?

494
00:32:39,609 --> 00:32:42,525
- Begini, dia...
- Uh... Dia jelas-jelas bukan ayahku.

495
00:32:42,569 --> 00:32:44,136
Bukan.

496
