Kenna, bantu di kasir dua.

562
00:36:39,762 --> 00:36:41,677
Bawa kantong sendiri?

563
00:36:41,721 --> 00:36:43,288
Tidak ada.

564
00:37:12,534 --> 00:37:14,319
Apa dia mirip denganku?

565
00:37:15,842 --> 00:37:17,887
Ya, dia mirip.

566
00:37:18,888 --> 00:37:20,803
Seperti apa dia?

567
00:37:33,599 --> 00:37:35,209
Kau jalan kaki ke tempat kerja?

568
00:37:35,253 --> 00:37:36,906
Ya.

569
00:37:36,950 --> 00:37:37,994
Bawa payung?

570
00:37:38,038 --> 00:37:39,779
Tidak.

571
00:37:39,822 --> 00:37:41,346
Kau bisa pesan Uber.

572
00:37:41,389 --> 00:37:44,653
Apa sudah ada Uber sebelum
kau... Masuk penjara? Ya.

573
00:37:44,697 --> 00:37:46,046
Ya, sudah ada Uber.

574
00:37:47,047 --> 00:37:48,918
Tetap saja aku tak punya ponsel.

575
