♪ Ada di sampingku ♪

585
00:38:41,623 --> 00:38:43,930
♪ Maukah kau tetap ♪

586
00:38:43,973 --> 00:38:46,889
♪ Di sampingku? ♪

587
00:38:46,933 --> 00:38:50,240
♪ Maukah kau, maukah kau ♪

588
00:38:50,284 --> 00:38:55,507
♪ Menemaniku, menemaniku? ♪

589
00:38:55,550 --> 00:38:56,986
♪ Maukah kau tetap... ♪

