Kau tak perlu merisaukan hal itu.

968
01:05:22,461 --> 01:05:26,444
Kenna, aku menerima
perintah penahanan Ledger?

969
01:05:26,487 --> 01:05:28,185
Semuanya baik-baik saja?

970
01:05:28,228 --> 01:05:31,492
Ya. Hm... Sayang kamu, D.

971
01:05:32,929 --> 01:05:35,061
♪ Terima kasih.
♪ Ya.

972
01:05:56,430 --> 01:05:57,823
Aku tak percaya mereka setega ini.

973
01:05:57,871 --> 01:05:59,289
Perintah Penahanan

974
