1001
01:07:37,227 --> 01:07:38,967
Biar kuantar.

1002
01:07:40,404 --> 01:07:44,016
Hm... Boleh juga. Ayo.

1003
01:07:44,060 --> 01:07:45,278
- Tentu.
- Baiklah.

1004
01:08:16,353 --> 01:08:17,571
Apa?

1005
