♪ Kelopak mataku terasa berat ♪

1079
01:13:48,946 --> 01:13:52,079
♪ Jiwaku terasa hampa ♪

1080
01:13:52,123 --> 01:13:54,560
♪ Tak tahu ke mana arah tujuanku ♪

1081
